<section id="about"><h2>About EstateHub</h2><p>EstateHub is an academic real estate marketplace project for browsing listings, saving properties and contacting property owners.</p></section>
<section id="support"><h2>Help and support</h2><p>For account access, use <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/forgot-password">password recovery</a>. To ask about a property, open its details and use the inquiry form after signing in.</p><p>If the site cannot load listings or send email, contact the administrator who provided your EstateHub installation. A public support contact has not been configured.</p></section>
<section id="research"><h2>Property search guide</h2><p>Choose Buy or Rent, enter a city, then narrow your results by category, bedrooms and furnishing. Save properties to compare their price, location and size side by side.</p><p>Before making a commitment, independently verify ownership, approvals, total costs and property condition.</p></section>
<section id="careers"><h2>Careers</h2><p>No job openings are published on this installation.</p></section>
<section id="privacy"><h2>Privacy information</h2><p>Account features use the contact details you submit. Saved properties and preferences are associated with your account. Password recovery uses your email address. Property inquiries share the information you submit with the listing recipient.</p><p>A full operator-approved privacy policy has not been published for this academic installation. Contact your administrator for retention and deletion requests.</p></section>
<section id="terms"><h2>Terms and usage information</h2><p>Use accurate information when posting listings or sending inquiries. Listing content does not replace independent due diligence. This installation does not process property purchases or rental payments.</p><p>Formal operator-approved terms have not been published. This page is usage guidance and does not establish additional contractual terms.</p></section>
</body></html>